        "notes": "USGS May 2008 Cassini/Voyager mosaic at 803 m per source pixel (5760 × 2880), resampled into the shared texture layout. No additional detail is created. Coarse polar coverage, source seams and photographed shading remain; gray grid marks explicit no-data. Shared Shadows adds approximate globe lighting. Mean-radius sphere: the real equatorial ridge does not change the silhouette.",
